1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,731
Whoa! A pill?

2
00:00:00,755 --> 00:00:01,820
Where's the water?

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,075
He swallowed me dry!

4
00:00:03,115 --> 00:00:04,461
I'm stuck on your wall!

5
00:00:04,633 --> 00:00:06,009
Then three things happen.

6
00:00:06,049 --> 00:00:07,287
And I hate the third.

7
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:08,820
First, you stick to me.

8
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,625
Second... I start to melt!

9
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,699
Third, your medicine burns my lining.

10
00:00:12,739 --> 00:00:13,261
Ow!

11
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:15,198
Soon, every swallow will sting.

12
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:19,959
Ow! Why does my chest burn when I swallow?

13
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,612
A pill got stuck in your food pipe.

14
00:00:22,652 --> 00:00:24,720
It dissolved there and irritated it.

15
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,902
But here's the twist:
don't blame the medicine.

16
00:00:27,942 --> 00:00:29,787
It just needed a ride down.

17
00:00:29,967 --> 00:00:31,420
So water is the ride?

18
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,953
Exactly. A glass of water,
sitting or standing up.

19
00:00:35,133 --> 00:00:40,487
And with some antibiotics, the NHS says:
no lying down for thirty minutes.

20
00:00:40,933 --> 00:00:42,791
Wheee! This time I got my water!

21
00:00:42,967 --> 00:00:44,576
Whoa... a pill with water.

22
00:00:44,616 --> 00:00:45,335
Thank you!
